      en: ["Peter Paul Rubens was born in Siegen on June 28, 1577.", "The city was first mentioned in a document in the year 1079.", "The Upper Palace houses the Siegerland Museum with a Rubens gallery.", "Siegen currently has a population of about 102,000 inhabitants.", "The University of Siegen was founded in 1972.", "The city is located on the River Sieg, which gave it its name."],
